<thead>
<tr><th>Specification</th><th>Meebook E6</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td>Display</td><td>6-inch E Ink Carta, 1448×1072, 300 PPI</td></tr>
<tr><td>Processor</td><td>Quad-core 1.8 GHz</td></tr>
<tr><td>RAM</td><td>3 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>Storage</td><td>32 GB internal + MicroSD up to 512 GB</td></tr>
<tr><td>Operating System</td><td>Android 11 with Google Play Store</td></tr>
<tr><td>Connectivity</td><td>Wi-Fi, Bluetooth 5.0, USB-C, 3.5mm jack</td></tr>
