e device using the respective Android app. (5) Email EPUBs as attachments and open them on the E6 with a file manager or reading app.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"> <h3 itemprop="name">Is the Meebook E6 waterproof?</h3> <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"> <div itemprop="text"> <p>No, the Meebook E6 does not have an IP rating for water or dust resistance. Unlike the Kobo Clara BW (IPX8 rated for underwater submersion), the E6 should be kept away from water, bathrooms, and pools. This is the device's biggest practical limitation compared to similarly priced competitors.</p> </div> </div> </div> <div itemscope itemprop="mainEntity" itemtype="https://schema.org/Question"> <h3 itemprop="name">How much does the Meebook E6 cost and where can I buy it?</h3> <div itemscope itemprop="acceptedAnswer" itemtype="https://schema.org/Answer"> <div itemprop="text"> <p>The Meebook E6 is expected to retail at approximately $150 USD. It is available directly from Meebook's official store and through AliExpress. Availability on Amazon may follow as stock reaches international warehouses. Pricing in other regions has not been confirmed, but conversion from the expected Chinese retail price places it in the budget-to-midrange e-reader bracket.</p> </div> </div>
